<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <title>Flight Control RPM Repository</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/styles.f8a9942c.css">
</head>
    <header>
    <nav class="theme-layout-navbar navbar navbar--fixed-top">
        <div class="navbar__inner">
            <div class="theme-layout-navbar-left navbar__items">
                <a class="navbar__brand" href="/"><div class="navbar__logo"><img src="/assets/img/flight-control-horizontal-logo-full-color.png" alt="Flight Control Logo" class="themedComponent_mlkZ themedComponent--light_NVdE"></div></a>
                <div>RPM Repository</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
    <div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown">
    <h2>Repository</h2>
    <table class="dir-table">
        <tr class="dir-table-row">
            <th class="dir-table-header-name">Name</th>
            <th class="dir-table-header-mtime">Last Modified</th>
            <th class="dir-table-header-size">Size</th>
        </tr>
{{TABLE_ROWS}}
    </table>
    <h2>Installation</h2>
    <h3>EPEL 9 (RHEL 9, CentOS Stream 9, Rocky Linux 9)</h3>
    <div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#000000;--prism-background-color:#ffffff"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#000000"><span class="token plain">sudo dnf config-manager --add-repo https://rpm.flightctl.io/flightctl-epel9.repo<br />sudo dnf install flightctl-cli</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
    <h3>EPEL 10 (RHEL 10, CentOS Stream 10, Rocky Linux 10)</h3>
    <div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#000000;--prism-background-color:#ffffff"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#000000"><span class="token plain">sudo dnf config-manager addrepo --from-repofile=https://rpm.flightctl.io/flightctl-epel10.repo<br />sudo dnf install flightctl-cli</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
    <h3>Fedora</h3>
    <div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#000000;--prism-background-color:#ffffff"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#000000"><span class="token plain">sudo dnf config-manager addrepo --from-repofile=https://rpm.flightctl.io/flightctl-fedora.repo<br />sudo dnf install flightctl-cli</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
    <h3>Installing a specific version</h3>
    <div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#000000;--prism-background-color:#ffffff"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#000000"><span class="token plain">sudo dnf install flightctl-cli-0.9.3</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
    <h3>Locking package version, except for patch-level</h3>
    <div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#000000;--prism-background-color:#ffffff"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#000000"><span class="token plain">sudo dnf install python3-dnf-plugin-versionlock<br/>sudo dnf versionlock flightctl-0.9.*</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
    </div></div>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container container--fluid">
        <div>Last updated: 2025-10-03 14:53:33 UTC</div>
    </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>